      "description": "All /api/admin/** require an admin token — run 'Login as admin' first. The poll endpoints call the upstream feed (scheduled polling is on by default, so these are for on-demand refreshes). 'Reconciliation review queue' captures the first row's external id into {{unmappedExternalId}} for the candidate/upstream lookups.",
